@base = http://localhost:5107
@alice = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@bob = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Loaded modules
GET {{base}}/

### [Accounts] Get Alice
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}

### [Accounts] Withdraw 100 € → publishes WithdrawalMade
POST {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}/withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100 }

### [Transfers] Transfer from Alice to Bob → calls Accounts, publishes TransferMade
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 250 }

### [Transfers] Bob's history (Transfers module database)
GET {{base}}/transfers/account/{{bob}}

### [Notifications] Alice: withdrawal + transfer sent (fed only by the events)
GET {{base}}/notifications/{{alice}}

### [Notifications] Bob: transfer received
GET {{base}}/notifications/{{bob}}
